0..78 Comment "// A case on a `Bool` and a split of the unit, each of which refines its goal."
79..81 Comment "//"
82..158 Comment "// A match on a `Bool` parameter refines a later binder whose type reads the"
159..229 Comment "// parameter, as a match on a data parameter does. A split of a `Unit`"
230..308 Comment "// parameter reads the parameter as `*{}` in its goal. A decoder of sort codes"
309..327 Comment "// has this shape."
328..330 Comment "//"
331..406 Comment "// The checker reads one motive for each form of case: the goal of the case"
407..481 Comment "// under one binder of the scrutinee. It generalises that motive over each"
482..559 Comment "// later binder that an arm or the motive reads. Each arm reads the scrutinee"
560..621 Comment "// at its own form, and the kernel replays each refined case."
622..624 Comment "//"
625..640 Comment "// - see: #6110"
641..711 Comment "// - see: #3483 — the generalisation over a binder that an arm reads"
712..751 Comment "// - see: `eta.gandr` — the unit\'s η"
